            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The purpose of this ASRM Practice Committee report is to provide clinicians with principles and strategies for the evaluation and treatment of couples with infertility associated with obesity. This revised document replaces the Practice Committee document titled, &quot;Obesity and reproduction: an educational bulletin,&quot; last published in 2008 (Fertil Steril 2008;90:S21-9).</AbstractText>
